@title Motor at variable frequency: torque curves, breakdown and the current limit
@area Simulate
@sizes 1366x768
# Opens the two-speed hoist fixture (it has a motor) and the Simulate > Motor at variable
# frequency window.
open qa/fixtures/hoist-two-speed.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Motor at variable frequency
wait 4
key Enter
wait 30
expect "What this model leaves out"
shot motor-curves
check_layout
